<p><strong>Version-control hook configs.</strong> Commit your hook definitions to git. Later you'll ask, "when did this hook get added?" Git history answers it.</p>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre tabindex="0" data-language="bash" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed github-light"><code data-language="bash" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed github-light" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1">git</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#96D0FF;--shiki-light:#032F62"> add</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#96D0FF;--shiki-light:#032F62"> .claude-code/hooks.json</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="--shiki-dark:#F69D50;--shiki-light:#6F42C1">git</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#96D0FF;--shiki-light:#032F62"> commit</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-light:#005CC5"> -m</span><span style="--shiki-dark:#96D0FF;--shiki-light:#032F62"> "feat: Add security gate for main branch pushes"</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<hr>
<p>Hooks are the lever that turns Claude Code from a code generator into an automated workflow engine. The mental model is the hard part. Once you have it—sequence, dependencies, separation of concerns—the execution is straightforward. Start small, test thoroughly, and you'll have something powerful.</p></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle);flex-wrap:wrap"><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim);font-family:&#x27;DM Mono&#x27;, monospace;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-right:4px">Share</span><a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Claude%20Code%20Hooks%3A%20A%20Complete%20Field%20Guide%20to%20All%208%20Hook%20Types%20and%20How%20to%20Pick%20the%20Right%20One&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fclaudelab.net%2Fen%2Farticles%2Fclaude-code%2Fclaude-code-hooks-complete-guide-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X" title="X" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);color:var(--text-muted);transition:border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background 0.2s;text-decoration:none"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fclaudelab.net%2Fen%2Farticles%2Fclaude-code%2Fclaude-code-hooks-complete-guide-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook" title="Facebook" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);color:var(--text-muted);transition:border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background 0.2s;text-decoration:none"><svg width="15" h